# The mediacore.secrets scope's series (05-config §2.8): family<TAB>type<TAB>labels,
# checked by metricstest.AssertSeries in TestSecretsSeries_Golden. The families
# are observable instruments over the store's counters and its keyring; every
# op/outcome pair of secrets_operations_total is exported from zero.
